[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1026","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1026.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-43733","title":"Apple iOS macOS iPadOS 图像处理内存越界漏洞","description":"Apple macOS 系统中 USD（Universal Scene Description）库存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞，源于在将用户提供的特制数据复制到堆缓冲区之前未对数据长度进行充分验证。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过诱使目标用户打开恶意构造的 USD 文件或图片触发该漏洞，导致进程内存被破坏并在当前进程上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 macOS Sequoia 及 macOS Tahoe 等版本，CVSS 评分为 7.8，危害等级高。Apple 已在 macOS Sequoia 15.7.8 及 macOS Tahoe 26.6 安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-43733"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-27T21:16:58Z","updated":"2026-07-28T19:31:56Z","remediation":"建议用户立即升级设备系统：iPhone 升级至 iOS 26.6，iPad 升级至 iPadOS 26.6，Mac 升级至 macOS Sequoia 15.7.8 或 macOS Tahoe 26.6。对于无法及时更新的设备，应避免打开来源不明的图像文件，并可通过防火墙或内容过滤策略拦截未知图片格式的入站传输作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.apple.com/en-us/128066","https://support.apple.com/en-us/128067","https://support.apple.com/en-us/128071","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/71e7ec7831487791fa2712228e5e13057adec23c/cves/2026/43xxx/CVE-2026-43733.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/45fe7fc1a2f9ac2222fd28b77156af622e92fde8/2026/43xxx/CVE-2026-43733.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-43733.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-43733.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-43733.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-437xx/CVE-2026-43733.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/4de02d857778e2a09d389d9fc3f2041a10677e37/content/posts/cve-2026-43733.md","https://github.com/0xcrypto/applesec/blob/c7a6c72786570796bbf00a5a5e7e3e822a87c483/content/iOS/High/CVE-2026-43733.md","https://github.com/0xcrypto/applesec/blob/c7a6c72786570796bbf00a5a5e7e3e822a87c483/content/macOS/High/CVE-2026-43733.md","https://github.com/0xcrypto/applesec/blob/c7a6c72786570796bbf00a5a5e7e3e822a87c483/content/iPadOS/High/CVE-2026-43733.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1026.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1023","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1023.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-43729","title":"Apple iOS 及多平台操作系统图像处理内存损坏漏洞","description":"Apple 多款操作系统存在内存处理不当漏洞（CWE-119），由于未对恶意制作的图像文件进行充分验证，攻击者可构造特制图像诱导用户通过本地应用程序打开或预览，从而触发内存损坏并实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 iOS、iPadOS、macOS Sequoia、macOS Tahoe、tvOS 及 visionOS 等多个系统版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。攻击者需在目标设备上具备本地访问权限，且需用户交互才能完成利用。Apple 已在 iOS 26.6、iPadOS 26.6、macOS Sequoia 15.7.8、macOS Tahoe 26.6、tvOS 26.6 及 visionOS 26.6 中修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-43729"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-27T21:16:57Z","updated":"2026-07-29T20:25:07Z","remediation":"立即将 iOS/iPadOS 升级至 26.6、macOS Sequoia 升级至 15.7.8、macOS Tahoe/tvOS/visionOS 升级至 26.6。如暂无法升级，应避免打开来源不明的图片文件，并启用系统沙盒限制以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.apple.com/en-us/128066","https://support.apple.com/en-us/128067","https://support.apple.com/en-us/128069","https://support.apple.com/en-us/128070","https://support.apple.com/en-us/128071","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/52138c35bcb0784b4efb0e41fb1e599736d809a9/cves/2026/43xxx/CVE-2026-43729.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/45fe7fc1a2f9ac2222fd28b77156af622e92fde8/2026/43xxx/CVE-2026-43729.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-43729.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-43729.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-43729.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-437xx/CVE-2026-43729.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/4de02d857778e2a09d389d9fc3f2041a10677e37/content/posts/cve-2026-43729.md","https://github.com/0xcrypto/applesec/blob/c7a6c72786570796bbf00a5a5e7e3e822a87c483/content/iOS/High/CVE-2026-43729.md","https://github.com/0xcrypto/applesec/blob/c7a6c72786570796bbf00a5a5e7e3e822a87c483/content/tvOS/High/CVE-2026-43729.md","https://github.com/0xcrypto/applesec/blob/c7a6c72786570796bbf00a5a5e7e3e822a87c483/content/macOS/High/CVE-2026-43729.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1023.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1020","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1020.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-43673","title":"Apple iOS macOS 等多平台音频文件内存损坏漏洞","description":"Apple CoreAudio 组件存在越界写入漏洞（CWE-119），由 TrendAI 零日倡议（ZDI-26-491）匿名研究员发现并报告。该漏洞源于 CoreAudio 在处理 APAC 音频流时缺乏对用户提供数据的充分校验，攻击者可构造恶意的音频文件或媒体流，在解析过程中触发越界写入操作，导致进程内存被破坏，从而在当前进程上下文中执行任意代码。攻击者可通过远程方式（如诱导用户访问恶意网页或打开恶意文件）利用此漏洞，且无需任何权限，仅需用户进行交互操作即可触发。该漏洞影响 iOS 26.6 及更早版本、iPadOS、macOS Sequoia 15.7.8 及更早版本、macOS Sonoma 14.8.8、macOS Tahoe 26.6、tvOS 26.6、visionOS 26.6 和 watchOS 26.6 等众多 Apple 设备。CVSS 评分 7.8（高危），Apple 已于 2026 年 7 月安全更新中通过改进内存处理和边界检查修复了此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-43673"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-27T21:16:52Z","updated":"2026-07-28T19:31:29Z","remediation":"建议将受影响的软件升级到厂商发布的最新安全版本，或根据官方安全公告应用相应的安全补丁。如暂无补丁，建议采取临时缓解措施限制攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.apple.com/en-us/128066","https://support.apple.com/en-us/128067","https://support.apple.com/en-us/128068","https://support.apple.com/en-us/128069","https://support.apple.com/en-us/128070","https://support.apple.com/en-us/128071","https://support.apple.com/en-us/128072","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/52138c35bcb0784b4efb0e41fb1e599736d809a9/cves/2026/43xxx/CVE-2026-43673.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/45fe7fc1a2f9ac2222fd28b77156af622e92fde8/2026/43xxx/CVE-2026-43673.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-43673.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-43673.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-43673.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-436xx/CVE-2026-43673.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/4de02d857778e2a09d389d9fc3f2041a10677e37/content/posts/cve-2026-43673.md","https://github.com/0xcrypto/applesec/blob/c7a6c72786570796bbf00a5a5e7e3e822a87c483/content/iOS/High/CVE-2026-43673.md","https://github.com/0xcrypto/applesec/blob/c7a6c72786570796bbf00a5a5e7e3e822a87c483/content/tvOS/High/CVE-2026-43673.md","https://github.com/0xcrypto/applesec/blob/c7a6c72786570796bbf00a5a5e7e3e822a87c483/content/macOS/High/CVE-2026-43673.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1020.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0832","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0832.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59729","title":"Astro Astro renderHTMLElement 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Astro 是一个面向内容驱动型网站的前端框架。其 SSR 渲染路径中的 `renderHTMLElement()` 函数在构建 HTML 元素属性时，直接将扩展运算符传入的属性名（`attr`）未经转义地拼接到属性字符串中，仅对属性值进行了转义处理。此前 CVE-2026-54298 的修复仅加固了 `addAttribute()` 路径，但 `renderHTMLElement()` 拥有独立的属性循环逻辑，未经过 `addAttribute()` 的检查。当 SSR 运行时环境定义了全局 `HTMLElement`（如 Deno、Bun 或使用 jsdom/happy-dom 的 Node 环境），且存在继承自 `HTMLElement` 的组件直接接收攻击者可控键名的扩展属性时，攻击者可通过注入包含事件处理器（如 `onmouseover`）或 `<script>` 标签的恶意属性名，突破属性上下文限制，实现跨站脚本攻击（XSS）。该漏洞影响 Astro 7.0.6 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 5.1，危害等级中危。官方已在 7.0.6 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59729","GHSA-f48w-9m4c-m7f5"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-27T20:16:40Z","updated":"2026-07-28T16:17:16Z","remediation":"立即将 Astro 升级至 7.0.6 或更高版本（npm update astro），该版本在 renderHTMLElement 中增加了属性名校验逻辑。如无法立即升级，避免在 SSR 运行时（Deno、Bun 带 DOM shim、jsdom/happy-dom）中使用继承自 HTMLElement 的自定义组件接收不可信扩展属性（spread props），或改用 Node 默认 SSR 环境（HTMLElement 为 undefined 时该分支不可达）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/5240e26c9dd91f9bc7140dcfacdb48d5a132830d","https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17251","https://github.com/withastro/astro/releases/tag/astro@7.0.6","https://github.com/withastro/astro/security/advisories/GHSA-f48w-9m4c-m7f5","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59729.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6ff73fb4bb99974a2b535c179f337dd820550366/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59729.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59729.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/753d2e0d725b348a212e8863d776d632b54550eb/data/2026/CVE-2026-59729.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59729.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59729.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/npm/astro/CVE-2026-59729.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-597xx/CVE-2026-59729.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-59729.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/61334472876cf5ad32f3637a7727b548d9acebb5/content/posts/cve-2026-59729.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0832.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0830","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0830.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59727","title":"Astro Astro 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Astro 是一个面向内容驱动型网站的 Web 框架。在 3.10.0 至 7.0.3 版本中，当 `transition:persist`、`transition:scope` 或 `transition:persist-props` 指令应用于客户端水合组件时，Astro 将指令值直接复制到渲染的 `<astro-island>` 元素上，未进行 HTML 转义。若开发者将攻击者可控的输入（如 URL 查询参数）反射到这些过渡指令中，攻击者可突破属性边界，向服务端渲染输出注入任意 HTML/JavaScript，导致反射型跨站脚本攻击（XSS）。利用前提是开发者将不可信的请求派生输入直接传递给过渡指令，这属于非惯用编码模式。该漏洞影响 Astro 3.10.0 至 7.0.3 版本，已在 7.0.4 版本中修复。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59727","GHSA-7pw4-f3q4-r2p2"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-27T20:16:40Z","updated":"2026-07-28T16:19:23Z","remediation":"立即升级至 astro@7.0.4 或更高版本（npm install astro@latest）。如无法立即升级，禁止将不可信的用户输入直接传递给 transition:persist、transition:scope 或 transition:persist-props 指令，必要时对输入进行 HTML 转义或严格校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/7ba0bb1dc7516e88caff9abd7767322af44b0294","https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17212","https://github.com/withastro/astro/releases/tag/astro@7.0.4","https://github.com/withastro/astro/security/advisories/GHSA-7pw4-f3q4-r2p2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59727.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6ff73fb4bb99974a2b535c179f337dd820550366/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59727.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59727.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/753d2e0d725b348a212e8863d776d632b54550eb/data/2026/CVE-2026-59727.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59727.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59727.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/npm/astro/CVE-2026-59727.yml","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-59727.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-597xx/CVE-2026-59727.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/61334472876cf5ad32f3637a7727b548d9acebb5/content/posts/cve-2026-59727.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0830.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0625","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0625.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55579","title":"Pheditor 硬编码默认管理员密码漏洞","description":"Pheditor 是一款用 PHP 编写的单文件编辑器与文件管理器。在 2.0.1 至 2.0.6 之前的版本中，程序在 pheditor.php 第 11 行硬编码了默认管理员密码 admin（SHA-512 哈希），且首次登录时无强制修改密码机制。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可使用默认凭据登录系统，获得文件编辑、文件上传及终端执行功能的完全访问权限，进而实现任意文件读写与远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Pheditor 2.0.1 至 2.0.6 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55579","GHSA-p4h7-p9rj-2pq2"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-27T18:16:56Z","updated":"2026-07-27T20:32:11Z","remediation":"立即升级 Pheditor 至 2.0.6 或更高版本，该版本已移除硬编码默认密码并强制首次登录时设置密码。如无法升级，手动修改 pheditor.php 中 PASSWORD 常量为强随机哈希值，并在部署后通过 Web 界面修改默认密码。同时建议在 Web 服务器层面限制 pheditor.php 的访问 IP 白名单作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/pheditor/pheditor/releases/tag/2.0.6","https://github.com/pheditor/pheditor/security/advisories/GHSA-p4h7-p9rj-2pq2","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/7fe82fb470b3291b506f74c6717a29e3837f8a29/2026/CVE-2026-55579.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55579.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55579.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/bf6bcb929801b1884cce701f7fcd855b05f0d401/2026/CVE-2026-55579.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55579.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4aa573a753d6387eff023ebcf6fc6297b912048e/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-555xx/CVE-2026-55579.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/packagist/pheditor/pheditor/CVE-2026-55579.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a9acb85c323f70b3c41e59a73040cf73e226b4d/2026/CVE-2026-55579.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/0c336e1b86972b4210fc8388a318964ce8d85a8e/content/posts/cve-2026-55579.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ab8274c38c7d8ccabeefbdd8551f85d2bf562fc9/api/2026/CVE-2026-55579.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/CVE-2026-55579"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0625.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0625.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0624","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0624.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55578","title":"Pheditor Pheditor 终端功能命令注入漏洞","description":"Pheditor 是一款单文件 PHP 编辑器与文件管理器，其 2.0.1 至 2.0.6 之前版本中的终端功能存在不完整的命令注入漏洞。该漏洞源于对用户输入命令的清理黑名单不完整——仅过滤了 &、;、|| 和 $ 字符，但未过滤 |（单管道）、`（反引号）和 0x0A（换行符）。已认证且拥有终端权限（默认开启）的攻击者可通过在允许的命令后附加管道符、反引号替换或换行符注入，绕过 TERMINAL_COMMANDS 白名单限制，执行任意操作系统命令。结合默认密码 admin，未授权攻击者也可利用此漏洞实现远程代码执行，完全控制 Web 服务器，造成机密性、完整性和可用性全面丧失。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55578","GHSA-wg4w-wr5q-6vjc"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-27T18:16:56Z","updated":"2026-07-27T20:32:11Z","remediation":"立即升级 Pheditor 至 2.0.6 或更高版本，该版本已修复终端功能中管道符、反引号和换行符绕过黑名单的问题。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用终端功能（移除终端权限），或在 Web 服务器层面限制对 pheditor.php 的访问。同时修改默认管理员密码，防止未授权用户利用终端功能。建议使用 `proc_open()` 替代 `shell_exec()` 并严格校验命令参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-9643-6xjp-vx57","https://github.com/pheditor/pheditor/releases/tag/2.0.6","https://github.com/pheditor/pheditor/security/advisories/GHSA-wg4w-wr5q-6vjc","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55578.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4aa573a753d6387eff023ebcf6fc6297b912048e/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-555xx/CVE-2026-55578.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/packagist/pheditor/pheditor/CVE-2026-55578.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a9acb85c323f70b3c41e59a73040cf73e226b4d/2026/CVE-2026-55578.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/0c336e1b86972b4210fc8388a318964ce8d85a8e/content/posts/cve-2026-55578.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ab8274c38c7d8ccabeefbdd8551f85d2bf562fc9/api/2026/CVE-2026-55578.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/e36efc5e409c591d3df35cbc8b963cbce54fde93/cve/CVE-2026-55578.html","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/37afb286f60474432f1104a39066604c98d29fb1/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-55578.json","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/9f4c8add5cfa40b9d0aceff1e12c078575600f8b/data/history/CVE-2026-55578.json","https://github.com/daffainfo/cvelist/blob/19b0012f47c88b880b258a20670efa5a60a65a04/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55578.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0624.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0624.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0624.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0440","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0440.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-16796","title":"AWS Bedrock AgentCore Python SDK 参数分隔符注入漏洞","description":"AWS Bedrock AgentCore Python SDK 的 install_packages() 方法中存在参数分隔符未正确中和的漏洞（CWE-88）。该 SDK 提供代码解释器功能用于在托管沙箱中安装 Python 包，但由于对包名参数输入验证不足，远程认证攻击者可通过构造特制的包名参数绕过过滤机制，在代码解释器沙箱环境中执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 bedrock-agentcore 1.18.1 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.4，危害等级高。AWS 已在 1.18.1 版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-16796","GHSA-j6g5-3hh3-pgw8"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-23T21:17:03Z","updated":"2026-07-24T20:47:41Z","remediation":"立即将 bedrock-agentcore Python SDK 升级至 1.18.1 或更高版本（`pip install --upgrade bedrock-agentcore`）。如无法升级，禁止将不可信或模型生成的输入传递给 `install_packages()` 方法，并对所有动态包名按 PyPI 命名规则严格校验，限制 extras 组为逗号分隔的合法标识符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://aws.amazon.com/security/security-bulletins/2026-065-aws/","https://github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/security/advisories/GHSA-j6g5-3hh3-pgw8","https://pypi.org/project/bedrock-agentcore/1.18.1/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2026/16xxx/CVE-2026-16796.json","https://github.com/crewAIInc/crewAI/blob/daa7019898ae52d30005478f436b7a5a808e2814/docs/edge/ar/changelog.mdx","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/a786a0ea61d8ccdfe1545c54db2093e7bac073d1/proposals/euvd/CVE-2026-16796.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-07-23/TIER_3_CVE-2026-16796.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/bedrock-agentcore/CVE-2026-16796.yml","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/869f3abc79bfeaf3a31640839c1759509ebcc74c/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-16796/README.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/59adead62d41f907bd4d8297210669925a301433/2026/16xxx/CVE-2026-16796.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-16796.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-j6g5-3hh3-pgw8/GHSA-j6g5-3hh3-pgw8.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-16796.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0440.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0931","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0931.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-64785","title":"Apple swift-nio-http2 HTTP/2头部值验证缺失导致请求走私漏洞","description":"SwiftNIO HTTP/2 实现在处理入站 HEADERS 帧时缺少对 CR、LF、NUL、SP 等控制字符的校验，攻击者可通过构造包含换行符或空格的恶意 HTTP/2 头部值，利用 HTTP2ToHTTP1Codec 编解码器将其注入到后端 HTTP/1.1 请求中，实现 HTTP 请求走私或响应拆分攻击。该漏洞影响使用 swift-nio-http2 且跳过了出站头部验证的应用程序，CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危。官方已在 1.45.0 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-64785","GHSA-q3g2-m552-3r9c"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-23T20:17:21Z","updated":"2026-07-24T21:16:45Z","remediation":"立即将 swift-nio-http2 升级至 1.45.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 HEADERS 帧中 CR/LF/NUL 等控制字符的校验缺失问题。如无法立即升级，确保启用 NIOHTTP1 的 outbound header 验证（enableOutboundHeaderValidation 保持默认开启），并避免在 HTTP/2 到 HTTP/1.1 的编解码管道中跳过出站验证。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/apple/swift-nio-http2/security/advisories/GHSA-q3g2-m552-3r9c","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2026/64xxx/CVE-2026-64785.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2026/64xxx/CVE-2026-64785.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-64785.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-64785.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-64785.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-647xx/CVE-2026-64785.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/swift/swift-nio-http2/CVE-2026-64785.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/aea030fdb9f850918f67ec4845c1a97cd9f61f7a/2026/CVE-2026-64785.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3325b9a058340dae0cf4a308bd7383225ee5322b/content/posts/cve-2026-64785.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/f785f3444159263c9afde232b5456d1f01686673/api/2026/CVE-2026-64785.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0931.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0439","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0439.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-16756","title":"Amazon aws-smithy-http-server 慢速拒绝服务漏洞","description":"aws-smithy-http-server 是 Amazon 基于 Rust 语言开发的 HTTP 服务端框架，其默认 serve() 路径缺少连接超时、头部读取超时以及并发连接数上限的限制。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过建立大量连接并发送不完整的 HTTP 请求（Slowloris 攻击方式），持续占用服务器套接字和任务资源，导致服务端资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 aws-smithy-http-server ≤ 0.66.4 版本，CVSS 评分 8.7，危害等级高。官方已在 0.66.5 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-16756","GHSA-jvxp-qmx7-gjpx"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-23T19:16:53Z","updated":"2026-07-23T20:17:07Z","remediation":"立即将 aws-smithy-http-server 升级至 0.66.5 或更高版本。该版本已添加连接超时、header 读取超时及并发连接数上限。如使用 AWS SDK for Rust 或基于 smithy-rs 的自定义服务，请更新 Cargo.toml 中依赖声明至 `aws-smithy-http-server = \">=0.66.5\"` 后重新编译部署。无其他有效缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://aws.amazon.com/security/security-bulletins/2026-064-aws/","https://crates.io/crates/aws-smithy-http-server/0.66.5","https://github.com/smithy-lang/smithy-rs/security/advisories/GHSA-jvxp-qmx7-gjpx","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2026/16xxx/CVE-2026-16756.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-07-23/TIER_2_CVE-2026-16756.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/cargo/aws-smithy-http-server/CVE-2026-16756.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/59adead62d41f907bd4d8297210669925a301433/2026/16xxx/CVE-2026-16756.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-16756.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-16756.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-jvxp-qmx7-gjpx/GHSA-jvxp-qmx7-gjpx.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/CYBERDUDEBIVASH-THREAT-INTEL-PLATFORM/blob/60016b74ba80d27b93157e3586c48ea49a6dd37f/reports/2026/07/intel--1784840350_CVE-2026-16756_CVE-2026-25800_CVE-2026-4.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0298403c910e42219c357a4f56dac428565b2e47/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-16756.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/08ea89e8807d0d5cf7150243c834721985237c9e/CVEs_log/2026-07-24_zh.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0439.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0438","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0438.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-16584","title":"AWS API MCP Server 安全策略绕过漏洞","description":"AWS API MCP Server 在启动时加载安全策略执行数据，若加载失败则静默跳过后续所有请求的安全策略检查，导致用户配置的 deny 和 gate 规则失效。攻击者可通过诱导服务器在数据加载失败状态下启动（如网络不稳定），绕过安全策略执行本应被拒绝的 AWS API 操作。该漏洞影响版本 0.2.13 至 1.3.46，CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高。修复方式为升级至 1.3.47 版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-16584","GHSA-29w2-fq35-v728"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-23T16:17:15Z","updated":"2026-07-23T19:16:53Z","remediation":"立即将 awslabs.aws-api-mcp-server 升级至 1.3.47 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可采取以下临时缓解措施：(1) 使用最小权限 IAM 凭证（如 ReadOnlyAccess 角色）限制可执行的操作范围；(2) 若服务器在断网状态下启动，待网络恢复后重启服务进程，确保安全策略数据正确加载。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://aws.amazon.com/security/security-bulletins/2026-063-aws/","https://github.com/awslabs/mcp/security/advisories/GHSA-29w2-fq35-v728","https://pypi.org/project/awslabs.aws-api-mcp-server/1.3.47/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2026/16xxx/CVE-2026-16584.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/a786a0ea61d8ccdfe1545c54db2093e7bac073d1/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-16584.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-07-23/TIER_3_CVE-2026-16584.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/awslabs.aws-api-mcp-server/CVE-2026-16584.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/59adead62d41f907bd4d8297210669925a301433/2026/16xxx/CVE-2026-16584.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-16584.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-16584.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-29w2-fq35-v728/GHSA-29w2-fq35-v728.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/CYBERDUDEBIVASH-THREAT-INTEL-PLATFORM/blob/60016b74ba80d27b93157e3586c48ea49a6dd37f/reports/2026/07/intel--1784826989_CVE-2026-16584_CVE-2026-16584.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0298403c910e42219c357a4f56dac428565b2e47/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-16584.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0438.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0809","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0809.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-56819","title":"Netty Netty HTTP/2 解压内存泄漏导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Netty HTTP/2 解压缩模块存在直接内存泄漏漏洞，当启用 HTTP/2 内容解压功能（DelegatingDecompressorFrameListener）时，远程未认证攻击者可向已关闭解压器通道的流发送 DATA 帧触发漏洞。漏洞原理在于 Http2Decompressor.decompress() 方法调用 decompressor.writeInbound(data.retain()) 时会先增加缓冲区引用计数，但当内部 EmbeddedChannel 已关闭时 writeInbound() 抛出 ClosedChannelException，导致额外的 retain() 从未被释放，每个 DATA 帧泄漏一个直接 ByteBuf。影响范围为 Netty 4.2.0.Final 至 4.2.15.Final 及 4.1.0.Final 至 4.1.135.Final 版本，攻击者只需在长连接中持续发送 END_STREAM 后的 DATA 帧即可耗尽直接内存导致 JVM 抛出 OutOfMemoryError 拒绝服务。该漏洞已在 4.1.136.Final 和 4.2.16.Final 中修复，CVSS 评分 7.5（HIGH）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-56819","GHSA-93wv-jw9v-4972"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-21T23:17:52Z","updated":"2026-07-30T14:46:35Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Netty 到 4.1.136.Final 或 4.2.16.Final 及以上版本（Maven 坐标：io.netty:netty-codec-http2）。若暂时无法升级，可在应用层禁用 HTTP/2 内容解压功能（移除 DelegatingDecompressorFrameListener），或在网络层限制长连接并发 DATA 帧数量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/netty/netty/commit/5b68c61f37aa4a3045cba624cbea239655c9003b","https://github.com/netty/netty/commit/bb2ff68a1fb71cb4b0eb9a9e17b66c52aff680c6","https://github.com/netty/netty/releases/tag/netty-4.1.136.Final","https://github.com/netty/netty/releases/tag/netty-4.2.16.Final","https://github.com/netty/netty/security/advisories/GHSA-93wv-jw9v-4972","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0235c22e9b6c7ddb8ada469b545320bce3ffcbfa/cves/2026/56xxx/CVE-2026-56819.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bc943eb819a406135c2391ed30d595e2ea60281b/2026/56xxx/CVE-2026-56819.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-56819.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-56819.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2026/CVE-2026-56819.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/afc0df6edf4ea320b0cfac74a53aafd9b4a9697f/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-56819.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-56819.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/afc0df6edf4ea320b0cfac74a53aafd9b4a9697f/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-56819.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-56819.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-56819"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0809.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0441","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0441.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-44907","title":"Meta React Server Functions 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"React Server Functions 组件（react-server-dom-webpack、react-server-dom-parcel、react-server-dom-turbopack）存在拒绝服务漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向服务器函数端点发送特制的 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，导致目标系统出现内存溢出异常或 CPU 资源过度消耗，造成服务不可用。该漏洞影响 19.0.0 至 19.0.7、19.1.0 至 19.1.8 及 19.2.0 至 19.2.7 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。官方已在 19.0.8、19.1.9 及 19.2.8 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-44907","GHSA-wx67-qw84-cm4g"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-21T17:17:08Z","updated":"2026-07-21T20:25:45Z","remediation":"立即将 react-server-dom-webpack、react-server-dom-parcel、react-server-dom-turbopack 升级至修复版本：19.0.x 系列升级到 19.0.8，19.1.x 系列升级到 19.1.9，19.2.x 系列升级到 19.2.8。如应用未使用 React Server Components 或服务端渲染，可确认不受影响无需操作；无法立即升级时，可在反向代理或 WAF 层限制对服务端函数端点的异常请求频率以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/react/react/security/advisories/GHSA-wx67-qw84-cm4g","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44907.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-07-21/TIER_3_CVE-2026-44907.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2b9f82473296f370428cbc110ec5b988e3fd692/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44907.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/npm/react-server-dom-parcel/CVE-2026-44907.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-44907.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-44907.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-44907.json","https://github.com/Vulnogram/Vulnogram.github.io/blob/03d1f7c2ed28d3f17bbbd1f667dea86eb0f34dfa/rss/meta.xml","https://github.com/JsHuang/sec-advisory-daily/blob/86aea41dd2762b8ae57edf00dafe081b4536e32d/reports/report-2026-07-27.html","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/6a49c1ee62b0cdcd9e0017ab19afbdf5bcbf6833/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-449xx/CVE-2026-44907.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0441.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0267","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0267.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-42931","title":"Gitea NPM包标签接口存在未限制内存读取导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Gitea是一个轻量级自托管的Git服务。其NPM包标签API端点(AddPackageTag)在处理HTTP请求体时使用io.ReadAll()无限制地读取全部数据到内存中，未做任何大小限制。任何认证用户可通过发送单个大HTTP请求(约服务器可用内存80%)触发OOM(内存耗尽)，导致Gitea进程被操作系统终止。该问题影响Gitea 1.27.0之前的所有版本，攻击不需要事先创建NPM包，且并发请求可造成持续拒绝服务(即使Docker自动重启也会被立即再次攻击致死)。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-42931","GHSA-wwqq-x6w4-frm2"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到Gitea 1.27.0及以上版本，该版本在AddPackageTag函数中增加了请求体大小限制。如无法立即升级，可考虑在反向代理层限制请求体大小(如nginx client_max_body_size)，或禁用包注册功能模块。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T15:18:31Z","references":["https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-wwqq-x6w4-frm2","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.27.0","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-wwqq-x6w4-frm2"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0267.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0249","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0249.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-23603","title":"Gitea OAuth2头像同步功能中的盲SSRF漏洞","description":"Gitea 在启用 [oauth2_client] UPDATE_AVATAR = true 时，会使用 Go 默认 HTTP 客户端从 OAuth2/OIDC 提供商获取头像 URL。该 URL 来源于用户 OIDC 的 picture 声明。受影响代码路径调用 http.Get(url) 时未对出站主机或 IP 进行限制。低权限用户通过控制自己的 picture 声明，可诱导 Gitea 服务器向任意地址发起 HTTP GET 请求，包括回环地址、RFC 1918 私有网络地址及链路本地地址（如 169.254.169.254），导致盲 SSRF 攻击。","severity":"LOW","score":3.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-23603","GHSA-x77v-q46j-393g"],"sources":["ghsa","cve"],"published":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到 Gitea v1.27.0 或更高版本，该版本在 OAuth2 头像同步路径中增加了出站请求的主机/IP 限制。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 [oauth2_client] UPDATE_AVATAR 配置项以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T12:14:29Z","references":["https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-x77v-q46j-393g","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38406","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38426","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/commit/de4b8277e9cb576f2315fb03b5ab6478b42a1d31","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/commit/f69e15afe7496cc62e96dab244629c69eb31a7bf","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.27.0"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0249.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0249.toml"}]